===Noun===
{{wikipedia|Umrah}}
{{en-noun|?}}

# {{lb|en|Islam}} A (or the act of) [[minor hajj]], a [[lesser]] [[pilgrimage]] to [[Mecca]], other than at the time of the [[hajj]].
